version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-16
repository-code: "https://github.com/AshrafBoussahi/eQoSystem-EON-GridExpansion"
abstract: >-
  Concept proposal and companion code for solving the distribution grid
  expansion problem (build-or-no-build line decisions that reduce congestion)
  with Pauli correlation encoding: an n-qubit register carries up to 3*C(n,k)
  decisions and the device runs three measurement settings at any problem
  size. The repository holds the proposal, the qGridX grid planning package
  (power flow, encoding, transformer circuit writer, decoder, N-1 screening,
  hardware path) and the genpce Qiskit-native circuit-synthesis library
  (discrete gradient-free circuit search validated against variational PCE up
  to 858 variables on 13 qubits).
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - combinatorial optimization
  - Pauli correlation encoding
  - distribution grid expansion planning
  - network congestion
  - power systems
  - Qiskit
